  "finding": "The selected relation repeats the same rune five positions later: 102 matches versus 60.6 expected. Four of 999 full 12-lag × 841-map shuffled searches equaled or exceeded its score (corrected p=0.005). The proposed lag-six formula was not the maximum.",
